${row('feature-document-ai','Automatically read editable documents','Send readable document text to cloud AI when I ask about it.','Separate opt-in, off by default. Requires Allow cloud AI, automatic active-page sharing and a normal session. Questions about your active supported editor may send up to 4,000 readable characters to the configured cloud AI without another preview approval. Only question-triggered reads run; no continuous monitoring, screenshots, private forms, password/payment fields, hidden writing or background tabs. Follow-ups reread the current editor; navigation or content changes stop ambiguous follow-ups. Disable this setting to stop automatic document reads. Turning off cloud, page or automatic-document sharing cancels active answers and removes manual snapshots too; you may explicitly approve a new manual snapshot afterward. Manual Read this document and Share selected text remain available with explicit per-excerpt approval. Google free-tier processing may use submitted content to improve products; do not share secrets.') }
${row('feature-research-ai','Allow public web research','Use your current public question for independent search.','Optional and off by default. Requires an owner-connected, verified free-only search service; if unavailable no search runs. Explicit current-information questions may use Exa search and retrieved public excerpts. Only the current question is searched, never page text or previous chat history. Do not include secrets. Free credit and shared limits apply; no paid fallback. <a href="https://exa.ai/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Exa privacy</a>.')}

